freedom of speech and expression is restricted. I personally think that it's a very powerful form of heroism in a different way, but in, you know, any time that you can get millions of people engage together, you can create change. And that's the hope. Can you tell us about your project, the Cyber Hero League? Sounds fascinating. Cyberhero League is a game that I'm in the process of developing. And what it is is just a way to spread the archetype knowledge about the archetype in a fun way to young people. I hope that people will play this across the age spectrum, but it's just a way to put the archetype out there
言论和表达自由受到限制。我个人认为这是一种截然不同的强大的英雄主义形式，但是，你知道，任何时候只要你能让数百万 人共同参与，你就能创造改变。这就是希望所在。您能给我们介绍一下您的项目“网络英雄联盟”吗？听起来很迷人。“网络英雄联盟”是我正在开发的一款游戏。它只是一种以有趣的方式向年轻人传播原型知识的方法。我希望人们能够在各个年龄段都来玩这款游戏，但这只是一种将原型推广出去的方式，

