00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:59.000
and empower people to realize that they can use technology in this way. What does the game do? How does it work? So the way the game works is the player signs up and his goal or her goal is to earn the badges of our participating nonprofit organizations. Right now we have over 13 nonprofit organizations and we're aiming to add more as we continue the development. But what the player will do is complete a series of apprenticeships
并赋予人们权力，让他们意识到他们可以以这种方式使用技术。这个游戏是做什么的？它是如何运作的？所以这个游戏的运作方式是玩家注册，他或她的目标是赢得我们参与的非营利组织的徽章。目前我们有13个以上的非营利组织，并且随着开发的继续，我们旨在增加更多。但玩家要做的是完成一系列的学徒期，

8
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:30.000
and in the process they'll earn the badge of that particular nonprofit. So instead of earning fake badges, they'll actually be earning the badge of the nonprofit. And some of our nonprofits are acting to protect indigenous peoples, the habitats of indigenous peoples. Others have to do with protecting the coral reefs and still others have to do with protecting the night sky from light pollution. So we have a real large variety of areas that the players will learn about and take action
在这个过程中，他们将赢得那个特定非营利组织的徽章。因此，他们不会赢得虚假的徽章，而是真正赢得非营利组织的徽章。我们的一些非营利组织致力于保护土著人民，土著人民的栖息地。其他组织则与保护珊瑚礁有关，还有一些与保护夜空免受光污染有关。因此，我们有非常广泛的领域供玩家了解并采取行动。

