on behalf of. So one of the novel things about the Cyber Hero League is while the player is completing the apprenticeships and playing the games, he or she is actually contributing to the towards the goals of the nonprofits. In other words, funds are then given to the nonprofits, and the player gets the credit for having, let's say, you know, saved an acre of rainforest or fed someone or provided medicine or shelter and so forth. So they're actually making a difference in the world while they're playing. Are you inspired by what you've discovered in your research? Yes, I am inspired by what I've discovered in my research.
因此，“网络英雄联盟”的新颖之处在于，当玩家完成学徒期并玩游戏时，他或她实际上是在为非营利组织的目标做出贡献。换句话说，资金随后会捐给非营利组织，而玩家则因“拯救了一英亩雨林”或“喂养了某人”或“提供药物或庇护所”等而获得荣誉。因此，他们在玩游戏的同时实际上正在对世界产生影响。您对在研究中发现的成果感到受启发吗？是的，我对在研究中发现的成果感到受启发，

10
00:06:13.000 --> 00:07:08.000
because I believe that this form of collaborative heroism is empowering and the cyber impact is also important because right now we hear so much about the cyber bully. We hear about cyber stalkers. We hear about cyber crime. We hear about cyber war. We very rarely hear anything, any positive words that have to do with the Internet. And I do believe that some of the previous... research I looked at in digital altruism and now in the cyber hero and collaborative heroism help us to expand the way that we think of the potential of the web, that it can be used, and it is being used in positive ways. And in order to promote that idea in society, we have to have words with which to speak of it. Great. Thank you so much for joining us,
因为我相信这种协作式英雄主义具有赋能作用，而且网络的影响也很重要，因为现在我们听到了太多关于网络霸凌者的消息。我们听到了网络骚扰者的消息。我们听到了网络犯罪的消息。我们听到了网络战的消息。我们很少听到任何与互联网有关的积极言辞。而且我确实相信，我之前研究过的一些关于数字利他主义的课题，以及现在对网络英雄和协作式英雄主义的研究，有助于我们扩展对网络潜力的思考方式，即它能够被使用，并且正在以积极的方式被使用。为了在社会中推广这一理念，我们必须有能够谈论它的词汇。太好了，非常感谢您加入我们，

